          }
        },
        "text_KmUR6b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Let's be real: after 40, things don't work like they used to. Lower testosterone, sluggish circulation, and fading drive aren't just frustrating—they affect your confidence in and out of the bedroom.</p><p>Wellness Nest Shilajit Gummies deliver 1500mg of pure Himalayan Shilajit with 85+ trace minerals designed to support healthy testosterone levels, blood flow, and sustained energy—so you can show up when it counts.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong><br/>2 gummies daily. Most men notice improved drive and stamina within 6-8 weeks of consistent use.</p><p>✔ Supports healthy erections & blood flow<br/>✔ Boosts natural testosterone<br/>✔ No pills, no prescriptions, no awkward pharmacy runs<br/>✔ No awkward labels. Just a clean wellness pouch</p><p></p>"
          }
        }
      },
