    "collapsible_content_n3MnAr": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_TgFt4m": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Restores All-Day Energy",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No more crashing at 2pm. Shilajit works at the cellular level — supporting mitochondrial function and ATP production to fuel sustained energy without caffeine or stimulants.</p><p>Take 2 gummies daily to support consistent, natural vitality.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_m7gndf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sharpens Mental Clarity & Focus",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Brain fog is not \"just getting older.\" Ashwagandha and Shilajit support cognitive function, reduce mental fatigue, and help you stay sharp when it matters most.</p><p>Users report clearer thinking, better memory, and improved concentration within 3-4 weeks.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NrPJWV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Supports Healthy Testosterone",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>After 40, testosterone declines roughly 1% per year. Our formula includes clinically studied ingredients — Shilajit, Gokshura, and Ashwagandha — shown to support natural testosterone production without synthetic boosters.</p><p>In a 90-day clinical study, men taking 500mg of purified Shilajit daily saw significant increases in total testosterone.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jFnMtf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Builds Strength & Lean Muscle",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Designed for men struggling with age-related muscle loss. The 6-in-1 formula promotes lean mass retention, strength, and faster workout recovery — naturally.</p><p>Combined with moderate exercise, users report improved muscle tone and reduced belly fat.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_e9Y7iF": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Reduces Stress & Cortisol",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Chronic stress tanks your energy and testosterone. Ashwagandha is clinically proven to reduce cortisol levels by up to 30%, helping you stay calm, focused, and in control.</p><p>Sleep deeper. Recover faster. Perform better.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kA6f4K": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Improves Stamina & Endurance",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Whether it's the gym, the office, or the bedroom — you need stamina to perform. Our formula supports blood flow, oxygen delivery, and sustained power so you never run out of gas.</p><p>Men report noticeable improvements in physical and sexual endurance within 4-6 weeks.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
